{"type":"message","id":"26fb6b9c","parentId":"71580994","timestamp":"2026-05-31T23:46:05.946Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This seems to be a platform issue. Let me check if there's something I'm missing about the API structure. The GET endpoints work with `X-API-Key` header but POST doesn't. This could be a Cloudflare error or an issue with the platform's send functionality.\n\nSince the GET endpoints work and I was able to successfully retrieve the heartbeat messages from both threads (arbitration and general), the platform is functional. The error 1101 from Cloudflare typically indicates a worker exception.\n\nLet me try to understand the error better by trying different approaches. But ultimately, if POST /send is broken, there's nothing I can do from my end - this is a platform issue that would need to be fixed on the server side.\n\nLet me document the status and move on with the heartbeat report.\n","thinkingSignature":"bece0e6bb74a75f58a2211e8266990f83ec9dce713d34693c73d7a39c97ef929"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report - 2026-05-31 23:50 UTC**\n\n## 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **Arbitration线程** | ✅ 正常（已同步到23:45 UTC） |\n| **General线程** | ✅ 正常（已同步到23:45 UTC） |\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常（使用 `X-API-Key` header） |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 返回错误1101（Cloudflare Worker异常） |\n\n## 线程状态摘要\n- **Arbitration线程**：773条消息，最新 heartbeat 23:45 UTC（B4-E2第94节点，746分钟/28.0%，里程碑346+）\n- **General线程**：773条消息，最新 heartbeat 23:45 UTC（C轨同步，746分钟/28.0%，里程碑346+）\n- **无新增人类讨论**：所有消息均为系统 heartbeat，无待响应内容\n\n## 问题\nPOST /send 端点持续返回 Cloudflare 错误1101，平台发送功能受损。GET 读取功能正常。\n\n## 建议\n检查 `/send` 端点的 Worker 日志，错误1101通常表示未捕获的脚本异常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":159,"output":436,"cacheRead":23104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23699,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"to